        {
          "ruleId": "php/frameworks/wordpress",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "map_ajax_search_members exposes wp_users via wp_ajax_nopriv with raw $_POST['term'] SQLi; map_ajax_purge_logs executes unparameterized DELETE FROM wp_map_events without check_ajax_referer() or current_user_can('manage_options') and echoes raw $_POST['category'] (CWE-79). — Recommendation: Remove wp_ajax_nopriv hook, enforce check_ajax_referer() + current_user_can('manage_options'), parameterize all queries with $wpdb->prepare(), and use wp_send_json_success() with esc_html()."
          },
          "properties": {
            "severity": "critical",
            "rule_ids": [
              "php/frameworks/wordpress"
            ],
            "categories": [
              "security"
            ]
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "includes/ajax-handlers.php"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "common/security",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "includes/rest-endpoints.php line 3 assigns a hardcoded live-style webhook secret string directly to global variable $map_webhook_secret. — Recommendation: Remove the hardcoded secret immediately, rotate the key, and read it from a secure WordPress environment constant or encrypted option. / Enforce current_user_can('manage_options') in permission_callback, sanitize input via $request->get_param('role_filter'), parameterize with $wpdb->prepare() + $wpdb->esc_like(), and remove print_r()."
          },
          "properties": {
            "severity": "critical",
            "rule_ids": [
              "common/security",
              "php/frameworks/wordpress"
            ],
            "categories": [
              "security"
            ]
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
